        ["已读"] = "Read",
        ["悬浮窗基于 ETW 技术无需安装驱动；若未显示，请确认程序以管理员身份运行。渲染延迟（帧提交→屏幕合成）仅在窗口化/无边框游戏下有效，全屏独占不显示。数据记录期间只缓存在内存、不边采边写，不影响游戏帧率；单次最长 2 小时，到点自动停止并保存。"] = "The overlay uses ETW and needs no driver; if it doesn't show, make sure the app runs as administrator. Render latency (frame submit → screen compose) only works in windowed/borderless games, not fullscreen exclusive. During recording, data is buffered in memory rather than written continuously, so game FPS isn't affected; a session lasts up to 2 hours, then stops and saves automatically.",
        ["烤机（压力测试）是装机/换硬件后的必修课：让 CPU、显卡、内存长时间满负荷运行，验证系统稳定性与散热能力。一键三烤把常用的 CPU / 显卡 / 内存烤机整合在一个页面里，配合实时温度、功耗、频率监控，烤完心里有底。"] = "Stress testing is a must after building or upgrading a PC: run CPU, GPU and memory at full load for a long time to verify stability and cooling. One-click Triple Stress combines CPU/GPU/RAM tests on one page with live temperature, power and clock monitoring — so you finish with confidence.",
        ["「流氓软件的克星」是流氓软件清理中心：打开后默认进入「右键菜单管理」分区，左侧导航还提供「右键菜单管理-顽固软件版」（主动拦截）、「弹窗/流氓诊断」和「恢复中心」，可清理流氓右键菜单、实时拦截写回行为并一键恢复误删项。"] = "'Rogue Software Nemesis' is the rogue-cleanup center: it opens on the 'Context Menu Manager' section by default; the left nav also offers 'Context Menu Manager – Stubborn Apps' (active blocking), 'Popup/Rogue Diagnostics' and 'Recovery Center' — clean rogue context menus, block write-back behavior in real time and restore mistaken removals with one click.",
        ["开机慢、后台一堆莫名进程，多半是启动项太多。启动项管理基于 Sysinternals Autoruns，扫描注册表 Run、启动文件夹、计划任务、服务等 17 类自启动位置，取消勾选即可禁止开机自启。"] = "Slow boots and mystery background processes usually mean too many startup items. Startup Manager is built on Sysinternals Autoruns and scans 17 autostart locations (Run keys, Startup folders, scheduled tasks, services, etc.) — untick an item to stop it from launching at boot.",
        ["切换到「右键菜单管理-顽固软件版」并启用主动拦截，流氓软件写回右键菜单的行为会被实时拦截；在「拦截列表/操作记录」中审查待审核条目，选择「放行」「放行并信任」「保持拦截」或「停止追踪」。"] = "Switch to 'Context Menu Manager – Stubborn Apps' and enable active blocking: rogue attempts to write back context-menu entries get blocked in real time; review pending items in 'Block List / Activity Log' and choose 'Allow', 'Allow & Trust', 'Keep Blocking' or 'Stop Tracking'.",
        ["在右侧「数据记录」卡片里勾选要记录的指标（FPS、CPU/GPU、内存、磁盘、网络），点「开始记录」；停止后一次性写出 JSON / Markdown 文件，可用「打开输出文件夹」查看。"] = "In the 'Data Recording' card on the right, tick the metrics to record (FPS, CPU/GPU, memory, disk, network) and click 'Start Recording'; on stop it writes JSON/Markdown files all at once — use 'Open Output Folder' to view them.",
        ["切换到「弹窗/流氓诊断」分区，点「刷新」开始诊断，页面列出可疑的自启动项等流氓行为；可点「勾选可清理」或「只勾低风险」快速选择，再点「清理勾选」执行清理，「证据报告」可导出详细结果。"] = "Switch to the 'Popup/Rogue Diagnostics' section and click 'Refresh' to start the scan; suspicious startup items and other rogue behavior are listed. Use 'Check Cleanable' or 'Check Low-Risk Only' to select quickly, then 'Clean Checked' to clean; 'Evidence Report' exports the details.",
        ["优先禁用路径位于 Temp 目录、名称乱码或来源不明的条目；若发现启动项被流氓软件反复写回，可用「流氓软件的克星」的「顽固软件版」主动拦截；杀毒软件、声卡驱动的辅助服务请谨慎禁用。"] = "Prefer disabling items located in Temp, with garbled names or unknown origins; if rogue software keeps writing startup items back, use 'Stubborn Apps' in 'Rogue Software Nemesis' to block it; be careful disabling services belonging to AV or audio drivers.",
        ["选择 CPU 烤机并点击开始，建议连续运行 15～30 分钟。台式机 CPU 满载温度一般不超过 95℃，笔记本不超过 90℃；若频繁撞温度墙出现降频，说明散热需要改善。"] = "Pick CPU stress and start; run for 15–30 minutes. Desktop CPUs should stay under 95°C at full load, laptops under 90°C; frequent thermal throttling means cooling needs improvement.",
        ["快速验机是新电脑到手后的第一件事：核对硬件配置是否与商家承诺一致、检查硬盘是否被使用过、屏幕有无坏点、外设是否正常。本工具把验机流程拆成一步步引导，跟着走完即可。"] = "Quick Inspection is the first thing to do with a new PC: verify the hardware matches the seller's spec, check the drive isn't used, the screen has no dead pixels and peripherals work. This tool breaks it into step-by-step guidance — just follow along.",
        ["列表列出系统中的右键菜单项及其来源软件，可用搜索框定位；勾选后点「隐藏选中」禁用流氓菜单项、「显示选中」恢复，还支持「修改名称」「添加菜单」「删除菜单」。"] = "The list shows context-menu items and their source software; use the search box to locate one. Tick items then click 'Hide Selected' to disable rogue entries or 'Show Selected' to restore; 'Rename', 'Add Menu' and 'Delete Menu' are also supported.",
        ["装了很多软件后，右键菜单会变得越来越臃肿。右键菜单管理可以按来源列出文件右键、文件夹右键、桌面右键等菜单项，一键禁用不需要的第三方菜单，让右键恢复清爽。"] = "After installing lots of software the context menu gets bloated. Context Menu Manager lists entries by source (file, folder, desktop menus, etc.) and disables unneeded third-party items with one click — keeping the menu clean.",
        ["将不需要的菜单项开关关闭；改动需要重启资源管理器才会在右键菜单里生效，页面顶部提供了一键「重启资源管理器」按钮。禁用只是隐藏，不会删除软件本身。"] = "Turn off the switches for unneeded entries; changes take effect after restarting Explorer — there's a one-click 'Restart Explorer' button at the top. Disabling only hides entries and never deletes the software itself.",
        ["点「更多位置」管理新建/发送到/打开方式等菜单；点「系统高级」处理 WinX、现代及 IE 旧式菜单；点「技术位置」查看条目对应的注册表位置。"] = "Use 'More Locations' for New/Send To/Open With menus; 'System Advanced' handles WinX, modern and legacy IE menus; 'Technical Locations' shows the registry location behind each entry.",
        ["页面提供 CPU 烤机、显卡烤机（FurMark）、内存测试等入口，下方实时显示各部件的温度、功耗与频率曲线，烤机过程中请持续观察这些指标。"] = "The page offers CPU stress, GPU stress (FurMark) and memory tests, with live temperature, power and clock curves for each component below — keep an eye on these during the test.",
        ["第一步展示 CPU、显卡、内存、硬盘、屏幕等关键硬件信息，请逐项与购买页面的配置单核对，重点确认内存容量/频率、硬盘型号与容量、显卡型号。"] = "Step one shows key hardware (CPU, GPU, memory, drive, screen); check each item against the listing, focusing on RAM capacity/speed, drive model and capacity, and GPU model.",
        ["页面会列出当前系统的右键菜单项及其来源软件；利用搜索或按分类浏览，找到你想清理的条目（例如\"某压缩软件\"、\"某网盘\"的右键项）。"] = "The page lists your context-menu entries and their source apps; search or browse by category to find the entries to clean (e.g. a compression app's or a cloud drive's menu items).",
        ["在主界面左侧分类导航中找到「{tool.Name}」（分类：{tool.Category}），点击卡片打开；也可用顶部搜索框直接搜索。"] = "Find \"{tool.Name}\" in the left category nav (category: {tool.Category}) and click the card; you can also search from the top box.",
        ["勾选顶部「隐藏微软条目」开关，列表将只显示第三方软件的启动项，重点排查对象一目了然；也可通过顶部标签页切换类别、用搜索框精确查找。"] = "Turn on 'Hide Microsoft Entries' at the top and the list shows only third-party startup items — suspects at a glance; you can also switch categories via the tabs or search precisely.",
        ["像聊天一样输入你的需求，例如\"帮我看看 C 盘还剩多少空间\"\"清理一下垃圾\"；AI 会给出答案，必要时自动调用对应工具。"] = "Type your request like a chat, e.g. \"check how much space is left on C:\" or \"clean some junk\"; the AI answers and auto-invokes the right tool when needed.",
        ["登录启动项（注册表 Run、启动文件夹）几秒内即可列出；服务、计划任务、驱动等其余类别会在后台继续补扫，完成后自动合并进列表。"] = "Logon startup items (Run keys, Startup folders) are listed within seconds; services, scheduled tasks and drivers finish scanning in the background and merge into the list automatically.",
        ["性能测试可以对 CPU、内存、硬盘进行标准化跑分，量化整机性能；还可进行核间延迟测试，用于甄别 CPU 缓存/内存控制器异常。"] = "Performance Test runs standardized CPU/memory/disk benchmarks to quantify your machine; it also measures core-to-core latency, useful for spotting CPU cache or memory-controller faults.",
        ["旧格式（.doc/.ppt/.wps 等）转换需要本机安装 Office 或 WPS；视频转换速度取决于分辨率与编码设置。"] = "Converting legacy formats (.doc/.ppt/.wps, etc.) requires Office or WPS installed locally; video conversion speed depends on resolution and encoding settings.",
        ["查看硬盘的通电次数与累计使用时间：全新机器通电时间通常应在几十小时以内；通电时间过长或写入量很大，可能是样机或二手硬盘。"] = "Check the drive's power-on count and total hours: a brand-new machine should show well under a hundred hours; much more, or heavy writes, suggests a demo or used drive.",
        ["选择显卡烤机（FurMark）并开始，满载温度一般不超过 85℃。注意观察风扇转速是否正常拉高、画面是否稳定不花屏。"] = "Pick GPU stress (FurMark) and start; full-load temps should stay under 85°C. Watch that fans ramp up properly and the image stays stable without artifacts.",
        ["烤机前请确保电源模式为高性能/最佳性能，笔记本务必插电；烤机时留意室温与出风口；若温度异常升高或出现焦味请立即停止。"] = "Before stress testing, set the power mode to High/Best Performance and plug in laptops; watch room temperature and exhaust airflow; stop immediately if temps spike abnormally or you smell burning.",
        ["进入屏幕检测环节，工具会依次显示纯色画面，检查坏点、亮点与漏光情况；纯白看暗点、纯黑看亮点/漏光、纯红绿蓝检查彩点。"] = "In the screen test the tool cycles solid colors to check for dead pixels, bright dots and light bleed: white reveals dark dots, black shows bright dots/bleed, red/green/blue reveal colored defects.",
        ["隐藏/删除前先看清菜单项来源，不确定的条目可先「复制信息」查询再处理；所有清理记录均进入恢复中心，误操作可随时还原。"] = "Check an entry's source before hiding/deleting; for uncertain items use 'Copy Info' to look it up first. Every cleanup goes to the Recovery Center, so mistakes are restorable anytime.",
        [".NET 环境补全检测系统缺失的 .NET 运行时并自动安装，解决部分软件提示\"缺少 .NET\"无法运行的问题。"] = ".NET Runtime Repair detects missing .NET runtimes and installs them automatically, fixing apps that refuse to run with a 'missing .NET' error.",
        ["验机建议在联网状态下进行（部分硬件信息需要在线比对）；发现配置不符或硬件存在问题，第一时间保留截图证据再联系商家。"] = "Do the inspection while online (some hardware info needs online comparison); if the config differs or hardware is faulty, capture screenshot evidence first, then contact the seller.",
        ["对比宽带套餐标称速率：实际下载速度（MB/s）≈ 标称带宽（Mbps）÷ 8；延迟一般在 50ms 以内体验良好。"] = "Compare with your plan's rated speed: real download (MB/s) ≈ rated bandwidth (Mbps) ÷ 8; latency under about 50ms feels good.",
        ["Hosts 编辑提供图形化的 hosts 文件编辑器，支持添加/屏蔽域名解析条目，常用于屏蔽广告域名或本地调试。"] = "Hosts Editor provides a graphical editor for the hosts file — add or block domain-resolution entries, handy for blocking ad domains or local debugging.",
        ["游戏监控提供游戏内帧率（FPS）、帧生成时间、渲染延迟与硬件占用率的悬浮窗显示，无需驱动，管理员权限下自动生效。"] = "Game Monitor shows in-game FPS, frame time, render latency and hardware usage in an overlay — no driver needed, active automatically with admin rights.",
        ["UniGetUI 包管理器集成了 Winget、Scoop 等包源，可以像应用商店一样搜索、安装、更新电脑软件。"] = "UniGetUI integrates package sources like Winget and Scoop — search, install and update software like an app store.",
        ["在主界面进入「系统工具」分类，点击「一键三烤」卡片；也可以直接使用主界面顶部的搜索框输入\"烤机\"快速定位。"] = "Open the 'System Tools' category on the main screen and click the 'One-click Triple Stress' card; or type \"stress\" into the top search box.",
        ["全部项目通过即完成验机；如发现异常，可用「硬件评分」「CPU-Z」等工具进一步交叉核实，并及时联系商家退换。"] = "Passing every item completes the inspection; if anything looks off, cross-check with tools like 'Hardware Score' or CPU-Z and contact the seller for a return promptly.",
        ["按页面引导测试键盘按键、USB 接口、摄像头与音频；键盘测试中按下的键位会高亮，摄像头测试会显示实时画面。"] = "Follow the page to test keyboard keys, USB ports, camera and audio; pressed keys highlight in the keyboard test and the camera test shows a live feed.",
        ["选择要显示的项目（FPS、帧时间、渲染延迟、CPU/GPU 占用、温度等）、位置与字号，保存后悬浮窗生效。"] = "Choose which items to show (FPS, frame time, render latency, CPU/GPU usage, temperature, etc.), the position and font size — the overlay updates after saving.",
        ["AI 助手内置了对话与智能工具调用能力：可以帮你改配置、查问题、整理文件，还能直接启动工具箱里的各种工具。"] = "The AI Assistant combines chat and smart tool-calling: it can change settings, troubleshoot, organize files and launch any toolbox tool for you.",
        ["后台节流省电神器（EcoQoS）可以把指定后台进程切换到低功耗模式，降低发热与耗电，适合挂机、下载场景。"] = "EcoQoS Power Saver switches chosen background processes to a low-power mode, cutting heat and battery drain — ideal for idling or downloading.",
        ["禁用操作仅修改注册表对应键值，随时可逆；建议只禁用明显不需要的第三方条目，系统自带的菜单项谨慎处理。"] = "Disabling only changes the corresponding registry values and is fully reversible; disable clearly unneeded third-party entries and be careful with built-in ones.",
        ["OptimizerDuck 优化鸭提供系统优化调整项合集（隐私设置、性能调整等），一键应用推荐配置。"] = "OptimizerDuck bundles system tweaks (privacy settings, performance adjustments, etc.) and can apply its recommended profile in one click.",
        ["依次按下键盘上的每一个键，对应键位高亮即表示响应正常；未高亮的键可能失灵，反复触发的键可能连击。"] = "Press every key in turn; a highlighted key means it responded. Keys that never highlight may be dead, and keys that retrigger may be double-firing.",
        ["核间延迟查询用于查看 CPU 各核心之间的通信延迟矩阵，辅助甄别 CPU 体质与内存控制器异常。"] = "Core-to-Core Latency shows the communication-latency matrix between CPU cores, helping spot CPU or memory-controller anomalies.",
        ["在主界面进入「安全工具」分类，点击「流氓软件的克星」卡片，页面默认定位到「右键菜单管理」分区。"] = "Open the 'Security Tools' category and click the 'Rogue Software Nemesis' card; the page starts on the 'Context Menu Manager' section.",
        ["在主界面进入「网络工具」相关分类，点击「WiFi 密码」卡片，工具自动扫描本机保存的网络配置。"] = "Open the 'Network Tools' category and click the 'WiFi Passwords' card; the tool scans the network profiles saved on this PC.",
        ["按\"IP 地址 + 域名\"的格式添加或修改条目；需要屏蔽某域名时将其指向 0.0.0.0。"] = "Add or edit entries as \"IP address + domain\"; to block a domain, point it to 0.0.0.0.",
        ["格式转换支持视频、音频、图片、文档等常见格式的批量转换：拖入文件、选择目标格式、排队自动处理。"] = "Format Converter batch-converts video, audio, images and documents: drop in files, pick a target format, and the queue handles the rest.",
        ["涉及删除、修改系统等敏感操作时，AI 会弹出确认面板，由你决定是否执行；不放心时选择拒绝即可。"] = "For sensitive operations like deleting or modifying the system, the AI shows a confirmation panel — you decide. If unsure, just decline.",
        ["在右侧格式列表中选择目标格式（如 MP4、JPG、PDF、DOCX），可设置输出质量等参数。"] = "Pick the target format from the list on the right (MP4, JPG, PDF, DOCX, etc.); output quality and other parameters can be adjusted.",
        ["网络调度器用于管理网卡优先级与系统代理设置，排查\"有网但网页打不开\"、多网卡切换等问题。"] = "Network Scheduler manages NIC priority and system proxy settings, helping with 'internet works but pages won't open' and multi-NIC issues.",
        ["页面显示设计容量与当前满充容量，两者之比即为电池健康度；健康度高于 80% 属于正常范围。"] = "The page shows design capacity vs current full-charge capacity; their ratio is battery health. Above 80% is normal.",
        ["CPU 天梯图收录主流处理器的性能排名，帮助你在装机、升级时快速判断 CPU 的性能档次。"] = "The CPU Tier List ranks mainstream processors, helping you judge performance tiers when building or upgrading.",
        ["用搜索框输入 CPU 型号（如 i5-14600KF），查看其在天梯图中的位置与相对性能。"] = "Type a CPU model (e.g. i5-14600KF) into the search box to see its position and relative performance.",
        ["跑分排行展示各地用户上传的性能测试成绩，可按硬件型号筛选对比，判断自己的机器是否发挥正常。"] = "Benchmark Ranking shows scores uploaded by users everywhere; filter by hardware model to see whether your machine performs as expected.",
        ["毒蘑菇测试是 GPU 压力测试工具：渲染体积着色画面让显卡满载，用于检验显卡稳定性与散热。"] = "Mushroom Test is a GPU stress tool: it renders a volumetric shader scene to load the graphics card and check stability and cooling.",
        ["正常情况下同一 CCX/簇内延迟明显低于跨簇延迟；个别核心延迟异常偏高可能意味着硬件问题。"] = "Normally intra-CCX/cluster latency is clearly lower than cross-cluster; a core with unusually high latency may indicate a hardware issue.",
        ["页面按主题（系统设置、软件安装、安全防护、硬件维护等）组织教程卡片，点击卡片进入具体内容。"] = "Tutorial cards are organized by theme (system settings, software installation, security, hardware upkeep, etc.) — click a card to read it.",
        ["烤机期间不出现死机、蓝屏、花屏、自动重启，温度平稳无异常飙升，即可认为散热与稳定性合格。"] = "If no freeze, BSOD, artifacts or unexpected reboots occur during the stress test and temps stay steady, cooling and stability pass.",
        ["启动任意全屏或窗口化游戏，悬浮窗会叠加显示实时数据；ESC 或按配置的快捷键可临时隐藏。"] = "Launch any fullscreen or windowed game and the overlay shows live data; ESC or your configured hotkey hides it temporarily.",
        ["点击开始后文件逐个处理，队列显示等待/转换中/完成/失败状态；单个文件失败不会中断批次。"] = "Files are processed one by one; the queue shows Waiting/Converting/Done/Failed. A single failure doesn't stop the batch.",
        ["游戏防晕 3D 通过在游戏画面上叠加参考点/网格，缓解第一人称 3D 游戏带来的眩晕感。"] = "3D Motion Sickness Helper overlays reference dots/grid on the game screen to ease first-person motion sickness.",
        ["可将得分与「跑分排行」中同型号机器的成绩对比，判断硬件是否被限制（如功耗墙、温度墙）。"] = "Compare your score with the same model in 'Benchmark Ranking' to see if the hardware is limited (power or thermal caps).",
        ["电池消耗分析读取电池设计容量与实际满充容量，估算电池损耗程度，判断笔记本电池健康状况。"] = "Battery Analysis reads design vs actual full-charge capacity to estimate wear and judge your laptop battery's health.",
        ["全屏界面需前台焦点，测试时请勿切换窗口；笔记本键盘个别多媒体键可能无显示，属正常现象。"] = "The fullscreen test needs foreground focus — don't switch windows during it; some laptop multimedia keys showing no response is normal.",
        ["局域网文件分享让同一网络下的手机、电脑通过浏览器直接互传文件，无需数据线与第三方账号。"] = "LAN File Share lets phones and PCs on the same network transfer files via browser — no cable or third-party account needed.",
        ["配置修改器可以修改系统读取到的硬件标识信息（机器码等），用于特定软件的多开或测试场景。"] = "Config Editor can modify hardware identifiers (machine codes, etc.) that the system reports, for specific multi-instance or testing scenarios.",
        ["按需勾选 CPU、内存、磁盘等测试项；跑分期间请勿进行其他重负载操作，以免影响得分。"] = "Tick the tests you need (CPU, memory, disk, etc.); avoid other heavy work during benchmarking so scores aren't skewed.",
        ["垃圾清理扫描系统临时文件、各类软件缓存、残留安装包等可安全清理的内容，释放磁盘空间。"] = "Junk Cleaner scans temp files, app caches and leftover installers — safe-to-clean content — to free up disk space.",
        ["端口占用查看列出当前所有监听端口及占用它们的进程，用于排查\"端口被占用\"类错误。"] = "Port Inspector lists all listening ports and the processes holding them — for tracking down 'port already in use' errors.",
        ["在主界面点击「UniGetUI 包管理器」卡片，启动独立的 UniGetUI 程序。"] = "Click the 'UniGetUI Package Manager' card on the main screen to launch the standalone UniGetUI app.",
        ["点击主界面右上角的 AI 助手按钮（或系统工具里的 AI 助手卡片），进入对话界面。"] = "Click the AI Assistant button in the top-right corner (or its card under System Tools) to open the chat.",
        ["修改硬件标识有风险，仅建议在明确知道自己在做什么时使用；重要软件的授权可能因此失效。"] = "Changing hardware IDs is risky — only do it if you fully understand it; licenses of important software may stop working.",
        ["在主界面进入「系统工具」分类，点击「快速验机」卡片，页面会按步骤引导完成整体验机。"] = "Open 'System Tools' and click the 'Quick Inspection' card to be guided step by step through the whole check.",
        ["所有清理操作都会按批次存入「恢复中心」，选中批次后点「恢复当前批次」即可一键还原。"] = "Every cleanup is stored as a batch in the 'Recovery Center'; select a batch and click 'Restore This Batch' to revert in one click.",
        ["建议把屏幕亮度调到较高档位并全屏观看；发现 3 个以上坏点可依据厂商政策申请售后。"] = "Set brightness fairly high and view fullscreen; 3+ dead pixels may qualify for after-sales service under vendor policy.",
        ["保存后 hosts 修改立即生效，浏览器可能需要清缓存或重启后刷新 DNS 缓存。"] = "Saved hosts changes take effect immediately; browsers may need a cache clear or restart to refresh DNS.",
        ["网页中可直接上传文件到电脑，或下载电脑上分享的文件；大文件传输时保持两端不要锁屏。"] = "On the web page you can upload files to the PC or download shared ones; keep both devices awake for large transfers.",
        ["列表中标出缺失的 .NET 版本，勾选后点击安装，工具自动下载官方安装包完成安装。"] = "Missing .NET versions are listed; tick and install — the tool downloads the official package and installs it automatically.",
        ["对目标进程开启 EcoQoS 节流，CPU 会以更低功耗运行；需要满速时随时关闭。"] = "Enable EcoQoS on the target process and the CPU runs at lower power; turn it off whenever full speed is needed.",
        ["跑分前关闭大型软件与游戏；笔记本插电并把电源模式调到高性能，否则得分会明显偏低。"] = "Close big apps and games before benchmarking; plug laptops in and set High Performance, or scores will be clearly low.",
        ["键盘测试以全屏键盘图展示按键响应：按下的键位即时高亮，用于排查失灵、连击的按键。"] = "The keyboard test shows a fullscreen keyboard: pressed keys highlight instantly, exposing dead or double-firing keys.",
        ["纯白画面看暗点，纯黑画面看亮点与漏光，红绿蓝画面检查彩色坏点；用方向键切换颜色。"] = "White shows dark spots, black shows bright spots and light bleed, red/green/blue reveal colored defects; arrow keys switch colors.",
        ["WiFi 密码查看可列出本机连接过的无线网络及其保存的密码，用于忘记密码时找回。"] = "WiFi Passwords lists networks this PC has joined and the saved passwords — recover them when forgotten.",
        ["把要转换的文件直接拖入虚线区域（或点击选择文件），支持一次拖入多个文件批量处理。"] = "Drag files into the dashed area (or click to browse); multiple files can be dropped at once for batch processing.",
        ["电脑使用教程提供从开机设置到日常维护的图文引导，适合刚接触电脑的用户按步骤学习。"] = "PC How-To Tutorials walks new users from first-boot setup to daily upkeep with step-by-step guidance.",
        ["首次启动 UniGetUI 需要初始化包源，耐心等待；安装来源请选择官方包源。"] = "First launch initializes package sources — be patient; prefer official sources when installing.",
        ["在设置中填入你自己的 AI 服务地址与密钥，即可获得完整的对话与工具调用能力。"] = "Fill in your own AI service URL and key in Settings to unlock full chat and tool-calling.",
        ["先完成一次本地性能测试，再与榜单同型号成绩对比，明显偏低时检查电源模式与散热。"] = "Run a local benchmark first, then compare with the same model on the leaderboard; if notably low, check power mode and cooling.",
        ["点击开始按钮，测试过程会持续数十秒，期间建议暂停下载、视频等占用带宽的行为。"] = "Click start; the test takes tens of seconds — pause downloads and video streams that hog bandwidth meanwhile.",
        ["恶意软件拦截器通过证书与策略手段拦截常见捆绑安装器与广告程序的静默安装行为。"] = "Malware Interceptor uses certificate and policy techniques to block silent installs by common bundlers and adware.",
        ["在主界面进入「系统工具」分类，点击「启动项管理」卡片，工具会自动开始扫描。"] = "Open 'System Tools' and click the 'Startup Manager' card; it starts scanning automatically.",
        ["取消勾选列表中的条目即可禁止其开机自启；操作即时生效，重启后不再自动运行。"] = "Untick an item to stop it launching at boot; the change is immediate and it won't auto-run after a restart.",
        ["在主界面进入「系统工具」分类，点击「屏幕坏点检测」卡片，进入全屏纯色显示。"] = "Open 'System Tools' and click the 'Screen Dead Pixel Test' card for fullscreen solid colors.",
        ["AI 助手的回答仅供参考；执行破坏性操作前请务必阅读确认面板中的操作内容。"] = "AI answers are for reference; always read the confirmation panel before destructive operations.",
        ["点击开始后画面进入实时渲染，显卡负载迅速拉满；观察温度、风扇与帧率稳定性。"] = "After clicking start the scene renders live and GPU load maxes out; watch temps, fans and frame-rate stability.",
        ["镜像文件较大（数 GB），请确保磁盘空间充足；重装系统前务必备份重要数据。"] = "Images are several GB — make sure you have disk space; always back up important data before reinstalling.",
        ["在主界面进入「系统工具」分类，点击「垃圾清理」卡片，工具会自动开始扫描。"] = "Open 'System Tools' and click the 'Junk Cleaner' card; scanning starts automatically.",
        ["默认只清理公认安全的项目；浏览器缓存清理后会重新加载网页，属于正常现象。"] = "Only items considered safely cleanable are cleaned by default; browser caches reload pages after cleaning — that's normal.",
        ["常用官网收录了常用软件与驱动的官方下载地址，避免误入下载站装到捆绑软件。"] = "Official Websites collects official download pages for common software and drivers, so you don't land on download sites and pick up bundleware.",
        ["下载驱动请认准官网或笔记本厂商的支持页面，避免第三方下载站的捆绑安装器。"] = "Get drivers from official sites or your laptop vendor's support page — avoid third-party download sites and their bundled installers.",
        ["点击开始后依次运行各项目，全程无需干预；测试完成后页面会显示各项得分。"] = "After clicking start the items run in sequence unattended; the page shows each score when done.",
        ["在主界面进入「系统工具」分类，点击「键盘测试」卡片，进入全屏测试界面。"] = "Open 'System Tools' and click the 'Keyboard Test' card for the fullscreen test.",
        ["手机等设备连接同一 WiFi 后，用浏览器扫码或输入地址打开分享页面。"] = "Connect phones or other devices to the same WiFi, then scan the QR code or enter the address in a browser to open the share page.",
        ["Windows 镜像用于下载官方系统镜像，配合制作启动盘进行系统重装。"] = "Windows Images downloads official system images for making a boot USB and reinstalling Windows.",
        ["下载完成后可使用 Rufus 等工具将镜像写入 U 盘，进行系统安装。"] = "After downloading, write the image to a USB drive with Rufus or similar to install the system.",
        ["在主界面点击「OptimizerDuck 优化鸭」卡片，启动独立程序。"] = "Click the 'OptimizerDuck' card on the main screen to launch the standalone app.",
        ["无线测速建议靠近路由器并用 5GHz 频段，多次测速取平均值更准确。"] = "For WiFi speed tests, stay near the router and use the 5GHz band; averaging several runs is more accurate.",
        ["hosts 文件改动会影响全系统域名解析，编辑前建议备份原文件内容。"] = "hosts changes affect system-wide name resolution; back up the original content before editing.",
        ["在主界面点击「局域网文件分享」卡片，工具会显示一个访问地址与二维码。"] = "Click the 'LAN File Share' card; the tool shows an access address and QR code.",
        ["浏览或搜索需要的软件，点击安装，工具会自动下载并静默安装官方安装包。"] = "Browse or search for software and click install — the tool downloads the official package and installs silently.",
        ["在主界面点击「.NET 环境补全」卡片，工具自动检测已安装的运行时。"] = "Click the '.NET Runtime Repair' card; the tool detects installed runtimes automatically.",
        ["修改网络设置后个别程序需要重启才能生效；公司内网环境请先咨询管理员。"] = "Some apps need a restart after network changes; on corporate networks, ask your admin first.",
        ["点击启用后，工具会部署对应的拦截策略，常见的捆绑程序将无法静默安装。"] = "Once enabled, the tool deploys blocking policies and common bundlers can no longer install silently.",
        ["如果工具运行异常，可尝试重新打开；涉及网络下载的工具请检查网络连接。"] = "If a tool misbehaves try reopening it; for download-based tools check your connection.",
        ["电池数据由系统电池接口读取，需笔记本带电池才有数据；台式机不适用。"] = "Battery data comes from the system battery interface — laptops only; not applicable to desktops.",
        ["屏幕坏点检测通过全屏纯色循环，帮助你发现液晶屏的坏点、亮点与漏光。"] = "The dead-pixel test cycles fullscreen solid colors to reveal dead pixels, bright dots and light bleed.",
        ["列表显示网络名称与对应的明文密码，可直接复制分享给需要连接的设备。"] = "The list shows network names with their plaintext passwords — copy them to devices that need to connect.",
        ["网速测试测量当前网络的下载、上传速度与延迟，用于验证宽带是否达标。"] = "Speed Test measures download, upload and latency to verify your broadband meets its plan.",
        ["GPU 天梯图收录主流显卡的性能排名，帮助判断显卡档次与升级空间。"] = "The GPU Tier List ranks mainstream graphics cards, helping judge tiers and upgrade headroom.",
        ["搜索显卡型号（如 RTX 4060），查看其排名与相对性能百分比。"] = "Search a GPU model (e.g. RTX 4060) to see its rank and relative performance percentage.",
        ["页面与悬浮窗显示当前上行/下行速度；可在设置中调整显示位置与样式。"] = "The page and overlay show current up/down speeds; adjust position and style in settings.",
        ["在搜索框输入软件名，选择合适的结果点击安装，无需再到处找官网下载。"] = "Type a software name, pick the right result and install — no more hunting for official downloads.",
        ["正版软件商店基于 Winget 提供常用正版软件的一键安装与更新。"] = "The Software Store (powered by Winget) offers one-click installs and updates for common genuine software.",
        ["测试会让显卡满载发热，散热不良的机器请缩短测试时间并注意监控温度。"] = "The test loads the GPU and heats it up; on poorly cooled machines shorten the run and watch temperatures.",
        ["教程中可直接点击\"打开对应工具\"按钮跳转到相关功能，边学边练。"] = "In tutorials you can click 'Open the tool' to jump to the related feature — learn by doing.",
        ["进入游戏后画面上会出现参考标记，帮助大脑建立稳定参照系，减轻眩晕。"] = "In-game reference markers help your brain keep a stable frame of reference, reducing dizziness.",
        ["每个人的适应情况不同，可多尝试几种样式；眩晕严重时应停止游戏休息。"] = "Everyone adapts differently — try several styles; if dizziness gets bad, stop playing and rest.",
        ["服务网点查询帮助你查找各品牌电脑的官方售后服务网点地址与联系方式。"] = "Service Locator finds official after-sales service points and contact info for each brand.",
        ["请勿对正在使用的游戏、剪辑等前台软件开启节流，否则性能会明显下降。"] = "Don't throttle foreground apps you're actively using (games, editors) — performance will drop noticeably.",
        ["若健康度明显偏低或掉电异常快，说明电池老化，可考虑联系售后更换。"] = "Clearly low health or unusually fast drain means an aged battery — consider after-sales replacement.",
        ["流量监控器在任务栏/悬浮窗实时显示上下行网速，并可统计每日流量。"] = "Traffic Monitor shows live up/down speeds in the taskbar/overlay and tallies daily traffic.",
        ["扫描完成后按类别列出可清理的项目与占用空间，勾选要清理的类别。"] = "When scanning finishes, cleanable items and their sizes are listed by category — tick what to clean.",
        ["清理完成后会显示本次释放的空间大小，可定期（如每月）执行一次。"] = "After cleaning it shows how much space was freed; run it periodically (e.g. monthly).",
        ["确保两端在同一局域网且防火墙放行；传输完成后建议停止分享服务。"] = "Ensure both devices are on the same LAN and the firewall allows it; stop sharing when done.",
        ["点击开始后自动运行核心间延迟测量，完成后以热力图展示结果矩阵。"] = "After clicking start the core-to-core latency measurement runs automatically and shows a heatmap matrix.",
        ["选择电脑品牌后跳转到对应官方售后页面，按城市搜索最近的维修点。"] = "Pick your brand to jump to its official service site and search for the nearest repair point by city.",
